Example Workflow
Create or update a filmmaker profile.
Describe the funding need.
Search for grants.
Review ranked opportunities.
Filter by eligibility, location, genre, budget, or deadline.
Compare promising opportunities.
Save the strongest matches.
Add opportunities to the application tracker.
Continue managing the funding pipeline from one workspace.
Why FilmFund

FilmFund is not intended to be another database of grant links.

Its purpose is to reduce the research burden surrounding film financing.

The long-term vision is an intelligent funding assistant that understands a
film project and continuously identifies realistic funding opportunities as
the project evolves.

